Segmention Cell Edge - License and Usage Notice
==================================================

Copyright (c) Alexandre Matov. All rights reserved except as granted below.

1. Scope
--------
This repository contains MATLAB source code developed by Alexandre
Matov for computing the extent of the cellular outline by pixel
intensity thresholding and active contours. The code depends on a
MATLAB toolbox that is NOT included in this repository -- see
DEPENDENCIES.md.

