4. Third-party components
--------------------------
This source code depends on MATLAB's Image Processing Toolbox, which is
not bundled in this repository -- see DEPENDENCIES.md. `cutFirstHistMode.m`
implements the unimodal thresholding algorithm from: Rosin, P.L.
"Unimodal thresholding." Pattern Recognition 34.11 (2001): 2083-2096.
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/222599572_Unimodal_thresholding
